            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Melissa Conger"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I cut the sugar in half and added 2/3 C Nestle' Quik as mentioned by another reviewer because I like mocha. *In order to get a flavorful mug full, I had to use SEVERAL HEAPING TABLESPOONS of mix, and it still had a watery 'instant' flavor that I did not care for. 'Fire Side Coffee' is a much better flavored mix for instant coffee, I think.",
